\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces Experiment C (\texttt  {StatefulAutoscaler}): overlay of active connections (orange, left axis) and replica count (blue, right axis) for runs~2-5 (run~1 excluded as outlined in Section~\ref {sec:exp_c_multi}). Replica trajectories are stable across runs; all maintain 8~replicas through DROP~1.}}{19}{}\protected@file@percent }
