\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Experiment D (HPA + custom connection metric): five-run overlay of active connections (orange, left axis) and replica count (blue, right axis). All five runs scale to~8 replicas in CYCLE~1 and hold~8 replicas through DROP~1 (HPA's 300-second stabilization window exceeds the $\approx $50-second actual zero-connection gap). Scale-down during FINAL DROP is slower (mean~313~s) versus the \texttt  {StatefulAutoscaler}'s 119~s.}}{19}{}\protected@file@percent }
